{"title": "Support & Contact", "description": "Support & Contact. Locate exact Arabic passages, trace references and scholarly positions across multi-volume works, and verify citations directly against primary texts — built on a Source First approach.", "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb container\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span aria-current=\"page\">Support &amp; Contact</span></nav><section class=\"page-head \"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Support &amp; Contact</p><h1>Get in touch.</h1><p class=\"lede\">About the app, a collection, or a reference that needs another look.</p></div></section><section class=\"container section compact-top two-column\"><div><form class=\"report-form\" method=\"post\" action=\"/api/reports\" data-report-form data-retention=\"30\"><label>Topic<select name=\"topic\" required><option value=\"reference\">Reference correction</option><option value=\"technical\">Technical issue</option><option value=\"access\">Access & payment</option><option value=\"other\">Other question</option></select></label><label>Email<span class=\"field-hint\">Optional, if you would like a reply.</span><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label><label>Details<textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"7\" minlength=\"10\" maxlength=\"10000\" required aria-describedby=\"report-hint\"></textarea></label><p id=\"report-hint\" class=\"field-hint\">Include the book, edition, page, or steps that led to the issue. Do not include passwords or unnecessary personal information.</p><label class=\"honeypot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Website<input name=\"website\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><label class=\"check-label\"><input name=\"consent\" type=\"checkbox\" required><span>I agree to the use of this information to address my report.</span></label><p class=\"fine-print\">Site submissions are disabled. Download a report copy or use the listed contact address.</p><div class=\"button-row\"><button class=\"quiet-button js-required\" type=\"button\" data-save-report>Download report copy</button></div><noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to submit a report, or use the listed contact address.</p></noscript><p class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></form></div><aside class=\"side-note\"><h2>Support & Contact</h2><a href=\"mailto:openturath@gmail.com\" class=\"contact-email\">openturath@gmail.com</a><hr><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/en/help/\">Help<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/en/privacy/\">Privacy Policy<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/en/security/\">Security reporting<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></a></aside></section>"}